# Add or update a test for any change in behavior

When a change alters what the code does, add a test for the new behavior or update the test that already covers it. A comment, a rename, or a formatting change needs no test.

```ts
// Asked to make "Hinson" match HUTCHINSON.
// Bad: change nameMatches and leave the tests as they are.
// Good: update the nameMatches test so it expects the new match, and make the code pass.
```
